'''EVA Unit-08''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 487
|rarity = UR
|name1 = EVA Unit-08
|name2 = EVA Unit-08 & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''EVA Unit-08 & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
EVA Unit-08's debuffs are unreliable if you want one specific debuff, but with multi-hit attack and 20% of chance of either freeze, weaken or knockback makes it a good [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] unit regardless. Its knockback is a double-edged sword, as while it is useful against most Floating enemies, it can be bad when there are strong backliners in a stage. EVA Unit-08 pushing too much will make it a easy target for backline enemies, so you will have to use it wisely.

As with any [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cat]], a viable strategy in some stages is to stack EVA Unit-08s at the beginning and let them all loose once you have the desired amount; even the toughest Floating enemies won't stand much of a chance against 2 or 3 EVA-08s stacked. Take note that this strategy will work only if the initial peons are weak ones like [[Doge]]s or [[Those Guys]].

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Crowd-Controller}}

